# Umbra investigation toolkit Tor client.
# OnionTrafficOnly: this SOCKS port refuses every non-.onion destination, so the tools are
# onion-only exactly like the Umbra Investigate browser instance. IsolateDestAddr gives every
# onion service its own circuit. Only the internal toolkit network may use the port.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050 OnionTrafficOnly IsolateDestAddr IsolateSOCKSAuth
SocksPolicy accept 172.30.90.0/24
SocksPolicy reject *
DataDirectory /var/lib/tor/data
Log notice file /var/lib/tor/notices.log
Log notice stdout
ClientOnly 1
AvoidDiskWrites 1
